OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry to start in the south,
OL,6,Fwhile rain and thicker cloud affect
OL,7,Fnorthern areas. Cloud and rain spread
OL,8,Fsouthwards through the day. It will
OL,9,Fremain blustery initially, especially
OL,10,Ffor exposed coasts, with winds easing
OL,11,Flater as skies clear. Unseasonably
OL,12,Fmild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny lingering cloud to the
OL,15,Fsouth will clear through the evening
OL,16,Fto leave a dry night with plenty of
OL,17,Fclear spells. Winds becoming light and
OL,18,Fturning rather cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
