OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday,
OL,6,Fleading to drier and brighter day with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells, although with
OL,8,Fa risk of showers throughout. Feeling
OL,9,Fnoticeably cooler in the northwesterly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry with sunny spells through the
OL,14,Fweekend and into Monday. Chilly nights
OL,15,Fbring a risk of frost and patchy fog.
OL,16,FBreezier later especially across
OL,17,Fwestern coasts and hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
